     "sev": "med",
     "text": "When Recover fails before a session is produced (recovery refused by checkRecoverable, or the strap download throws), RecordPanels sets fetchFailed = true. That hides the Recover card (recoverableDataSection requires !fetchFailed), but RetryFetchCard lives in activeSessionSection which requires selectedSessionType != nil, and Recover is offered with no type selected. The error alert's OK resets fetchFailed only when currentSession is .failed, which these paths do not set. The user is left with neither card until they pick a session type or start a new recording.",
